<title>USA: TABLE - Bear Stearns Cos sells $400 mln debt.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Bear Stearns Cos sells $400 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Bear Stearns Cos Inc was priced Friday, according to lead manager Bear Stearns &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER BEAR STEARNS COS INC</p>
<p>AMT $400 MLN	 COUPON 6.50 PCT   MATURITY 7/05/2000</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.818  FIRST PAY DATE 1/05/98</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 6.567 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 40 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1672))</p>
